Q: Remove leading zeros from input type=number A: <p>I am using this for replace first &quot;0&quot; from input (my input is type=&quot;text&quot;)</p>
<pre><code>let newValue = e.target.value
</code></pre>
<pre><code>if (
  newValue.length &gt; 1 &amp;&amp;
  newValue.startsWith('0') &amp;&amp;
  newValue[1] !== '.'
) {
  newValue = newValue.replace(/^0+/, '')
}
</code></pre>
